OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, becoming heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes later in the afternoon. Breezy
OL,8,Fthroughout, with winds strengthening
OL,9,Ffurther later in the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FInitial rain will clear
OL,12,Ftowards midnight, leaving a drier
OL,13,Finterlude with a few clear spells.
OL,14,FFurther cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Fwill then develop early Thursday
OL,16,Fmorning. Winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
