OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FCloudy first thing with a
OL,6,Ffew spots of rain. Soon becoming dry
OL,7,Fhowever with sunny spells for the
OL,8,Fremainder of the day. Winds light.
OL,9,FRain arriving later in the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FUnsettled
OL,12,Fduring this period with showers or
OL,13,Flonger spells of rain throughout.
OL,14,FOften windy or very windy at times,
OL,15,Fwith a risk of gales. Temperatures
OL,16,Faround average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
